#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:83
#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:84
#: 01b0d86f88164cdaa49f4aaeae65e46c 083a63c134f948cfb19083b4f1b6147c
#: 0dcddb3a1ee04934b4a071fed008e505 0fa5646d29644f9b8faf0d2d074731e9
#: 46c056a7690b4164aa2085660a3ca3fb 514f807ced204db988d63ff0820d9355
#: 541f1d705a8748a8a8354bb8bd17275b 64eb7118b3324d2888a769f97d63791a
#: 6f2c080b8c6a40b1a1e0c5bf79e173e1 b1c1448baf724f27805a37516da5aba3
#: c2fb68a4d1584a3cafe1040209a86963 cc8a3526a39347c9889b8a3f591ece3b
msgid ""
"Operating a powered vehicle of any kind can be a lot of fun. However, "
"nothing will ruin your day at the park more quickly than an accident or "
"running afoul of the law. Since we want you to have a great experience, "
"please make sure that you do all of the following:"
msgstr "操作任何类型的动力飞行器都非常有趣。但是，在公园发生事故或触犯法律会让您的一天迅速毁掉。为了确保您拥有良好的体验，请务必做到以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:87
#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:88
#: 0b78085b503e4eaa8da83b3364a515c4 16863bf5df994680bd2f0baa724de174
#: 3f435b225cfb4de6a3a49407854947cd 6754f1ad5f28431bbf2bc0823a8548d6
#: 8203ec1b7f50483db757fda8b7b6d0bc 875c670ef2424e59bf098bcece27a084
#: 8896e67e60be4c678b0c2a3df68a70b0 8a4ef338bc08454193d8c978ac9717a0
#: 8e9ba7ff68674557bb5d68d5ff2f7154 91dca52cbac14e4ab06f4d1b6a138ef3
#: 9d0b581d077449d591625f8220aafa6b a8b16797bf914ea0b38a46541050925a
msgid ""
"Operate within all local laws and regulations. For example, in the United "
"States, current regulations require you to operate most UAVs under 400 foot "
"above ground level, within line of site, and away from obstructions and "
"populated areas. Since these regulations vary from place to place, even "
"within the same country, ensure that you understand what you need to do to "
"stay compliant."
msgstr ""
"遵守所有当地法律法规。例如，在美国，现行法规要求您在地面上方400英尺以下、视线范围内、远离障碍物和人口密集区操作大多数无人机。由于这些法规因地而异，即使在同一国家内也可能不同，请确保您了解如何保持合规。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:93
#: 0c0de95161bd404299d5f348c295fe6e 113ba3ee35524652b466fbf2d95f7b40
#: 2909969c1d67416990f7ef9f585b04bf 3f7c1cb8757b43318e9e9673b525523b
#: 50e5945bab5b4abe91d632767e8d75cf 594d427346fe420da0f446eb71c9250d
#: 5c9378e928bf4731b4d849c0ea4fa039 69591aec2da04b468a59c2eb6a3802a2
#: 8e159d919ad748db82f907ece0faa560 be3eb115a21041efb48add53ca424182
#: be593871941248e69ba6e347b1e3aea6 caa023344d7e4f8db7be5b34a168f93b
msgid ""
"Never operate the vehicle or software in a way that could be dangerous to "
"you, other people, or property. Propellers, while rotating, could easily cut"
" you; if a UAV fell on a person or object, it could cause injury; a UAV "
"caught in power lines could cause an outage. As Ben Franklin said, “An ounce"
" of prevention is worth a pound of cure.”"
msgstr ""
"切勿以可能对您、他人或财产造成危险的方式操作飞行器或软件。旋转中的螺旋桨可能轻易割伤您；无人机落在人或物体上可能造成伤害；无人机卡入电线可能导致停电。正如本杰明·富兰克林所说，「一盎司的预防胜过一磅的治疗。」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:96
#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:97
#: 0352ddb4b06f4cf295c901a87444daa8 0b1ab411f1b44ccca52574aa91aec52f
#: 0dbf169ae40f481ebafa6c2db3d5ed89 19f34dad24a742359b2fa985a4f39c84
#: 43996c9250b04546b6bed50ecc6f62b5 6d95b59fc3f940ed942fff746830f2b9
#: 7157154755a54e80b80d22c20d7d76a7 7f73f9533c2b458e97802d3baa5f87f0
#: a1f56cdadfdd4d86b3f24b92cd83f973 bb634467c2d64b31a20ec3f8de434b86
#: d6195f84feb14357adb4d02d06768b1a fe6cac4aee2d446aa0978f8a3edcaeab
msgid ""
"Always keep in mind that software and hardware failures happen. Although we "
"design our products to minimize such issues, you should always operate with "
"the understanding that a failure could occur at any point of time and "
"without warning. As such, you should take the appropriate precautions to "
"minimize danger in case of failure."
msgstr ""
"始终牢记软件和硬件故障随时可能发生。尽管我们尽量设计产品以减少此类问题，但您应始终以随时可能发生故障且无任何预警为前提进行操作。因此，您应采取适当的预防措施，以在发生故障时将危险降至最低。"

